00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:32.850
But also when it comes to investment you can start really really really small. Obviously if you have a 401k

00:01:32.890 --> 00:01:37.739
at your job, which many people do, that is investing, but if you're thinking more about like active investment

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:42.390
there are very very easy low-cost ways that don't require you to potentially talk to a snake oil salesman.

